# Localization Guidelines

## File Organization
- File location: `app_[name]/localization/`
- Must include `en.dart` and `zh.dart`
- Translation keys must include app prefix
- Usage: `"[app_name]_key".tr(context)`

## Required Imports
```dart
import 'package:qyflutter/helper/localization_helper.dart';
```

## Translation Keys
- Use app prefix (e.g., qy_)
- Use dot notation for hierarchy (e.g., `qy_home_title`)
- Maintain consistency in translation keys
- Use descriptive key names

## Implementation
- Use tr() extension method for translations
- Must provide context parameter
- Use named parameters for dynamic content
- Handle pluralization properly

## Examples
```dart
// Basic usage
Text('qy_home_title'.tr(context))

// With dynamic content
Text('qy_welcome_message'.tr(context, ['John']))

// In a widget
class MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Text('qy_button_text'.tr(context));
  }
}
```

## Best Practices
- Ensure all language files contain the same keys
- Maintain translation accuracy
- Handle special characters and formatting
- Test all supported languages







